# Order Details Panel

Reference: `src/app/(app)/cutting-orders/OrderDetailsPanel.tsx` (opens from the open-folder icon on a cutting-orders Fit List row).

When the user says **order-details-panel**, reuse this instead of a modal, a new page, or the left docked-filter-panel.

## Chrome

- Starts **closed**. Each cutting-order row has **sys_image** action SVGs (`viewBox 0 0 56 56`, shown at 28px, two-tone fill + drop-shadow): **print**, then Send, then **open folder** (closed at rest, open tray on hover). Named files live in `public/sys_image/`. Print opens **cutting-order-print** in a new tab. Icons sit in the column **before** the action chip.
- If the row is dirty in edit, Fit List `tryLeave` runs first, then the panel opens.
- **Docked right**, width **95%**, slides over the list (does not shrink the table).
- Top edge is **below the white header + nav**, in the light gray (`bg-stone-50`) content area. Header stays visible.
- Overlay is **transparent** (click it to close). Panel has a **drop shadow** onto the page (from the left edge of the panel).
- Close with ×, overlay click, or Escape.
- Panel canvas is the **docked-panel-colors** details amber: `bg-[#eee8d3]` padding, inner card `border-[#ddd5bb] bg-[#f8f5e8]`, white Fit List and controls on it, same headings and field chrome as the rest of the page.
- Title is the serial **order_num** (number only).
- Top of the panel: **add-product** (see that rule) on the **right**, only after a lot is selected. Combo is order brand **and** the selected lot. **New** creates catalog merchandise for that lot (does not attach until Add). Inserts `cutting_order_products`.
- A cutting order belongs to **one brand**. Brand cannot change if the order has **lots or products**.
- Body is two columns: **left (~14rem)** Fit List of `cutting_order_lots` (`lot_no`; Add lot Combo of unused brand lots; **New** opens a create-lot popup using lots-catalog fields, brand locked to the order; **Settings** on that popup opens Colors/Patterns/Contents like the lots page; create does not attach until Add lot; after **Add lot** that lot’s row is selected). **Right** Fit List of products **for the selected lot only** — header **Product • {lot_no}** (lot in a light font); row label is the **model**. **variable-size/drop-matrix**, no lot grouping. After Open, readonly `• {qty_received} of {qty_ordered}` (e.g. • 15 of 18). Optional **bulk_order_qty**: edit is a blankable numeric; view shows `Bulk • {n}` only when not null. Bulk does not bind the sized total. **Instructions** sit under the size/drop grid (full width of that column). **Scale** on the row opens the **scale-panel**. **Copy** opens the **copy-list** popup (session clipboard of sized qty on this order). Add lots first, then products for that lot. Cannot delete a lot that still has products on the order.

Shared slide-over chrome lives in `src/components/filter/DockedPanel.tsx`. Do not reuse **docked-filter-panel** (left 30%, Filter/Reset) for order details.
